    69	 * It gets the security level and sets the httponly and samesite cookie flags
    70	 * appropriately.
    71	 *
    72	 * To force an update of the cookie flags we need to update the session id,
    73	 * just setting the flags and doing a session_start() does not change anything.
    74	 * For this, session_id() or session_regenerate_id() can be used.
    75	 * Both keep the existing session values, so nothing is lost,
    76	 * it will just cause a new Set-Cookie header to be sent with the new right
    77	 * flags and the new id (or the same one if we wish to keep it).
    78	*/
    79	function dvwa_start_session() {
    80		// This will setup the session cookie based on
    81		// the security level.
